# Generated by tools/debloat-analyze.py from the firmware's /system (then the extras at the end by hand): the executables the
# removed services ran, Amazon's test tools, and the libraries no file that stays can reach.  Applied by scripts/debloat.sh.
# Regenerate with, from the repository root and an unpacked firmware:
#   tools/debloat-analyze.py firmware/donut/rootfs/system --hassmic build/donut --hassmic scripts/system --hassmic scripts/device --out /tmp/files.list
# (docs/cloud-free.md).  Never in here: firewall.sh (lockdown.sh builds on it), libpryon, libmixerAPI, libasp, libcurl, libz, libopus, liblipc,
# libace_aipc; the three functions of libperf_cpu_info_parser are replaced by the stub in debloat.list instead.

