# The fourth pass (2026-10-21) is in debloat-pass4-*.list and debloat-pass5*.list, in groups that were each tested with a cold boot (its first try, in one go,
# moved libacehal_network_all.so, which twelve symbolic links point at, and the Echo lost its Wi-Fi; docs/cloud-free.md "The fourth pass").
